BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Skyhaven Band
DTSTART:20260502T180000
DTEND:20260502T210000
UID:1a61edd0d546da83@theblockpetaluma.com
DESCRIPTION:The Skyhaven Band performs a diverse range of cover material f
 rom Rock\, Soul\, Pop\, Blues\, Americana to Jazz. Their music aims to con
 nect audiences to the songs they know and love and to get their feet tappi
 ng and bodies moving!
LOCATION:The Block Petaluma
URL:https://skyhavenmusic.com
X-SOURCE:The Block Petaluma
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:ALTCITY Band
DTSTART:20260508T180000
DTEND:20260508T210000
UID:0867f56e482bef66@theblockpetaluma.com
DESCRIPTION:If you like music from Sheryl Crow\, Joan Osbourne\, Meredith 
 Brooks\, Alanna Myles\, Fleetwood Mac\, The Pretenders\, Jason Mraz\, The 
 Cure\, Four Non-blondes\, Hall &amp\; Oates\, Concrete Blond\, The Rolling
  Stones\, The Go-go’s\, The B52’s\, Melissa Etheridge\, Modern English
 \, Davis Bowie\, Blondie\, The Bangles\, ‘ Til Tuesday\, Jewel\, Taylor 
 Swift\, and many more\, then you’ll love our re-imagined cover songs and
  numerous original songs that will get your feet moving. We have a great d
 eal of fun entertaining an audience. Please join our mailing list.
LOCATION:The Block Petaluma
URL:altcityband.com
X-SOURCE:The Block Petaluma
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Block Fest: The Hots\, The SoulShake\, The Incubators Duo & Cody H
 ill
DTSTART:20260509T150000
DTEND:20260509T210000
UID:064ca06b4bf46fe9@theblockpetaluma.com
DESCRIPTION:Based in Petaluma\, California\, The HOTS have gained a follow
 ing by making well known songs entirely their own. No backing tracks here\
 , just four guys that love making music. 70's/80's Rock The SoulShake is a
  Northern California based reggae/rock band spreading good vibes through m
 usic. The Incubators make original soul-folk roots rock Cody Hill - solo v
 ibey country/reggae/indie originals Last set IncuHots!
LOCATION:The Block Petaluma
URL:https://www.instagram.com/theblockpetaluma?igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==
X-SOURCE:The Block Petaluma
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sakoyana
DTSTART:20260515T180000
DTEND:20260515T210000
UID:d68e449d9928c5ca@theblockpetaluma.com
DESCRIPTION:Sakoyana is a jazz-funk band from Sonoma County\, California. 
 Influenced by sounds and creations of all kinds. Primarily the music is ro
 oted in jazz\, blues\, and funk\, but is also influenced by western classi
 cal music\, hip hop\, Indian classical music\, space\, plants\, meditation
  and much more. The music strives to balance tight compositional structure
 s with improvisation and joyful noise.
LOCATION:The Block Petaluma
URL:sakoyana.com
X-SOURCE:The Block Petaluma
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mitchell Thomas Band w/ Moods of Melody
DTSTART:20260516T180000
DTEND:20260516T210000
UID:339a15ab2c3e15f8@theblockpetaluma.com
DESCRIPTION:Mitchell Thomas Band features some of the finest local musicia
 ns around including Faith Waligora on vocals\, Dave Sampson on guitar\, Be
 n Dubin on bass\, and Kyle Turek on drums. Mitchell’s music is a blend o
 f rock\, jazz\, and singer-songwriter with influences ranging from James T
 aylor to Pink Floyd. Between grooving beats and uplifting harmonies\, ther
 e’s plenty for any music enthusiast to enjoy. Opener: Moods of Melody ar
 e a Petaluma homegrown band who play their own unique style of soulful mus
 ic infused with groove and musical depth. The band consists of both the Tu
 rek brothers and the Schulte brothers\, giving the Moods a deep connection
  and bond that emanates outward to the many audiences they have entertaine
 d over the decades.
LOCATION:The Block Petaluma
URL:https://www.instagram.com/mitchellthomasmusic?igsh=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ%3D%3
 D&utm_source=qr
X-SOURCE:The Block Petaluma
END:VEVENT
