BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Callie Watts Band
DTSTART:20260529T180000
DTEND:20260529T210000
UID:a66d5462656d2436@theblockpetaluma.com
DESCRIPTION:Callie Watts is a dynamic and versatile vocalist known for her
  soulful voice\, magnetic stage presence\, and genre-spanning repertoire. 
 With a foundation rooted in jazz\, blues\, and classic soul\, Callie seaml
 essly blends contemporary influences with timeless sounds to create perfor
 mances that resonate with diverse audiences.
LOCATION:The Block Petaluma
URL:calliewatts.com
X-SOURCE:The Block Petaluma
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sonoma Shakers
DTSTART:20260530T180000
DTEND:20260530T210000
UID:d80b9792bb5c5c7f@theblockpetaluma.com
DESCRIPTION:The Sonoma Shakers are a Northern California high energy&nbsp\
 ;band&nbsp\;that brings a rockin vibe to every show\, playing a mix of Ori
 ginal songs\, R&amp\;B\, Country Rock\, and Blues.&nbsp\; Their contagious
  rhythms and enthusiastic performance create an environment that will insp
 ire you to get up and dance.&nbsp\;
LOCATION:The Block Petaluma
URL:https://www.facebook.com/sonoma.shakers?mibextid=ZbWKwL
X-SOURCE:The Block Petaluma
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pepper On The Run
DTSTART:20260605T180000
DTEND:20260605T210000
UID:6558c89236633788@theblockpetaluma.com
DESCRIPTION:The Pepper On The Run band is a tribute to the music of Sir Pa
 ul McCartney from The Beatles\, Wings and early solo songs! Pepper On The 
 Run plays all of his greatest music\, while leaving out the ones that are 
 too schmaltzy(No “Silly Love Songs” I “Say Say Say” here). One fan
  calls them\, “Beatles with balls!” They’re based in the San Francis
 co Bay Area. The members of Pepper on the Run are Tony Lemieux on lead voc
 als and guitars\, Peter Lomenzo on bass and vocals\, Ian Luke on drums\, S
 tu Dahlquist on guitar and vocals and John Snee on keyboards. The Pepper o
 n the Run tribute band’s magical mystery tour is coming to a town near y
 ou to take you away!
LOCATION:The Block Petaluma
URL:https://rambletone.com/pepper-on-the-run-tribute
X-SOURCE:The Block Petaluma
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:945
DTSTART:20260606T180000
DTEND:20260606T210000
UID:19ac7cb2529164d7@theblockpetaluma.com
DESCRIPTION:945-~Alt-Rock with Heart and Soul 945 is an alt-rock band that
  blends the gritty emotion and energy of '90s and 2000s rock with their ow
 n fresh\, authentic sound. The band came together through their shared lov
 e of alt-rock and their time with some of them working at the School of Ro
 ck in Santa Rosa. The chemistry between these four musicians is undeniable
 \, and their connection is evident in every performance. Lead singer Sophi
 a’s emotive and powerful vocals have quickly become a signature of the b
 and. Her unique ability to feel every note has earned her accolades\, incl
 uding Bohemian Magazine’s “Best Lead Vocalist” in the North Bay (202
 3-2024). The magazine also named 945 “Best Rock Band” in the North Bay
 .
LOCATION:The Block Petaluma
URL:https://www.instagram.com/945theband?igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==
X-SOURCE:The Block Petaluma
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Rambletone Blues Revue
DTSTART:20260612T180000
DTEND:20260612T210000
UID:a8bc22c48b45898f@theblockpetaluma.com
DESCRIPTION:The “Rambletone” blues revue is a hoppin’\, groovin’\,
  funky\, bluesy band based in the San Francisco Bay Area. The members of R
 ambletone are Tony Lemieux on vocals\, guitar and harmonica\, Ian Luke on 
 drums\, Bob Fruhlinger on bass\, Stu Dahlquist on guitars\, Willy Gross on
  saxophone and John Snee on keyboards. Rambletone has a number of influenc
 es based in the blues\, rockabilly\, Americana\, a dash of raggae and funk
 y jams to boot\, such as: Muddy Waters\, Allman Bros\, SRV\, Stray Cats\, 
 Howlin Wolf\, Clapton\, Marley\, the Dead ect. You can find Rambletone’s
  music online on all your favorite streaming sites!\; Including their albu
 m “Remixed &amp\; Reimagined”. You can also find them tearing up stage
 s all around the Bay Area!
URL:https://www.facebook.com/rambletone?mibextid=wwXIfr&mibextid=wwXIfr
X-SOURCE:The Block Petaluma
END:VEVENT
